<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela foreign reserves 15.13 bln at end of 96.</title>
<headline>Venezuela foreign reserves 15.13 bln at end of 96.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Venezuelan foreign reserves, boosted by large capital inflows that have stemmed from high international oil prices, are expected to close the year at $15.133 billion, according to the Central Bank's annual year-end review of the Venezuelan economy.</p>
<p>In 1995 Venezuelan foreign reserves fell $1.784, or 15.5 percent, to end the year at $9.723 billion.  </p>
<p>((-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
